BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Triangle Board Games & Bars
UID:event_315264555@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260616T044940Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260616T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260616T203000
SUMMARY:Cary Jaycees Monthly General Membership Meeting 
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Board Games and Bars\nThe Cary Jaycees\, your local c
 rew of young professionals who know how to blend community service with a 
 whole lot of fun. If you’ve ever wanted to meet awesome people\, make a 
 real impact\, or build your leadership skills while doing some seriously c
 ool projects\, this is your group. Some of our regular attendees don’t R
 SVP so please don’t be discouraged if others haven’t RSVPd\n\nThe Jayc
 ees are always looking for new members\, so if you’ve been thinking abou
 t getting more involved in Cary and beyond\, consider this your sign. The 
 Jaycees are an 18-40 year old group but we welcome everyone to be an alumn
 i member (poorly named as you don't need to be a past member.) We meet on 
 the third Tuesday of every month at Gamers Geekery and Tavern at 6:30 PM a
 nd would love for you to stop by\, say hello\, and see what they’re all 
 about. We cover the game fee for anyone playing with us and will also have
  appetizers to share.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/triangle-board-games-and-bars/events/
 315264555/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260615T033304Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260615T033304Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Triangle Board Games & Bars
UID:event_315017555@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260616T044940Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260618T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260618T230000
SUMMARY:Play Board Games at the Geekery
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Board Games and Bars\nCome play games at Gamers Geeke
 ry and Tavern every thursday night!\n\nStarting time is 6:30\, but feel fr
 ee to come in anytime and just hang out for the night. Group is very casua
 l and friendly.\n\nHow it works:\nCome on in\, grab a name tag and pay the
  $2.50 meetup participant fee at the bar area\, find the tables that are r
 eserved for the Meetup group\, play games with others who show up. Food an
 d drinks are available at the bar.\n\nPlease RSVP by noon day of. If less 
 than four people are able to attend a given Wednesday the event will be ca
 nceled.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/triangle-board-games-and-bars/events/
 315017555/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260529T224743Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260529T224743Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
